% HION-2016-05 fig_01b: equivalent photon approximation, two Pb82+ emit photons that fuse into X (right half; left half is a cartoon of the em fields)
layout: v2
in: pb1 pb2
out: pb3 x pb4
pb1 -- [fermion] a -- [fermion] pb3
pb2 -- [fermion] b -- [fermion] pb4
a [label=\mathrm{Pb}^{82+}]
b [label=\mathrm{Pb}^{82+}]
c [blob]
a -- [photon, label'=\gamma] c
b -- [photon, label=\gamma] c
c -- [proton] x [X]
